::  blazepod/glow/gate-boot-harness-matrix.glow -- Boot Matrix!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-boot-to-harness
  |=  [sifive=@ud posture=@ud caps=@ud]                ::  pin -> harness
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  dispatch ok
  ~|  'blazepod-boot-pin-or-harness-cap-refused'        ::  matrix refusal
  ?>  &(eql(sifive 21845) gth(caps 0))                  ::  0x5555 == pass
  posture
--
